I think the OP meant ey lost protection by angering the god, and so 
wants to regain it somehow.

Another way of regaining the money, btw, is with a tame foocubus, 
leprechaun, or nymph and conflict. That will keep the same priest 
around, and you can theoretically keep reusing the money. It takes a lot 
of patience though.

You can also polyself into a leprechaun, hit the priest, and then use 
charm monster or a magic harp or something to make them peaceful again. 
That's actually much more effective; you can pull off tens of thousands 
of z per hit, sometimes.

